######################################
# Android Signature README
######################################

Note: This signature app is currently under development, and is not
(currently) being shipped with mediaprovider.

######################################
# To install for development / testing:
######################################

Add Signature field in apex -> apps apex/Android.bp file and cherry-pick this cl ag/36581140

######################################
# Troubleshooting
######################################

Launching intent with com.android.signature.ACTION_PICK_SIGNATURE should bring you into the new
SignatureActivity. If not, try the installation steps above again. (Be sure to reboot)


######################################
# Testing
######################################
To run the tests:

atest SignatureTests

Note: SignatureTests bundles the application code with the tests, so the
app does not need to be installed first for the test suite to be run. The test
suite will bring along all the code it needs.
